{"type":"standard","title":"Michele Tafoya","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Michele Tafoya</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q6836854","titles":{"canonical":"Michele_Tafoya","normalized":"Michele Tafoya","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Michele Tafoya</span></span>"},"pageid":2757650,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/MicheleTafoya2023.jpg/330px-MicheleTafoya2023.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/MicheleTafoya2023.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2686,"height":3584},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1381624095","tid":"32e00187-cf15-11f1-a75b-43a0d3ffba97","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:08:58Z","description":"American former sports broadcaster (born 1964)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michele_Tafoya","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michele_Tafoya?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michele_Tafoya?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Michele_Tafoya"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michele_Tafoya","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Michele_Tafoya","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michele_Tafoya?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Michele_Tafoya"}},"extract":"Michele Joan Tafoya is an American former journalist and sports broadcaster. She worked for CBS, ABC, ESPN, and NBC. After beginning her career on Minneapolis-St.Paul-based radio and television stations, she became the host of CBS Sports Spectacular in 1994. Tafoya later joined ABC and ESPN, covering football and basketball. Most notably, from 2011 to 2022, she worked as a sideline reporter for NBC Sunday Night Football.","extract_html":"<p><b>Michele Joan Tafoya</b> is an American former journalist and sports broadcaster. She worked for CBS, ABC, ESPN, and NBC. After beginning her career on Minneapolis-St.Paul-based radio and television stations, she became the host of <i>CBS Sports Spectacular</i> in 1994. Tafoya later joined ABC and ESPN, covering football and basketball. Most notably, from 2011 to 2022, she worked as a sideline reporter for <i>NBC Sunday Night Football</i>.</p>"}